'''Everlord Wanwan''' (綺羅星ペロ, ''Kiraboshi Pero'', '''Beautiful Star Pero''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[King Wahwah]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Dogsville (Merciless)|Wanwan's Glory]]. He was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Everlord Wanwan
|image = E 506.png
|first appearance = [[Dogsville (Merciless)|Wanwan's Glory]]
|money drop = 9,999¢ - 39,426¢
}}

==Enemy==
Like King Wahwah, Everlord Wanwan is an Omni Strike attacker with multi-hit, high pushing power, extreme effective range, higher stats (meant to be fought after maxing all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]]) and more threatening abilities. Most of his damage is concentrated in the first two hits, while the last is a very weak attack that warps, locking cats out of battle for '''''66.67 seconds''''', which can compound easily and clog up the Cat Deploy Limit. He retains the weakness of many knockbacks, but is less vulnerable to that than King Wahwah, requiring 60,000 damage to be knocked back instead of 40,000 and thus can withstand a hit from [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] without flinching.

